    "detailed_description": "This is a hunting dinosaurs game whose goal is to protect primates (our ancestors) from dinosaurs of the Jurassic era.<br />\r\nYou have to keep alive primate who will be attacked for dangerous dinosaurs (T-Rex, Spinosaurus, Raptor, Triceratops, Brachiosaurus, Pteranodon, Stegosaurus, Dimetrodon, Paradophosaurus, ...).<br />\r\nYou will have many weapons, ammo and bullets to use for preserving primates alive. And you will have to keep you alive alone yourself.<br />\r\nYou can use different weapons, and you can take one in each hand.<br />\r\nYou will have missions with different difficult levels.<br />\r\nYou will feel danger and feel responsibility for your life and that of the other primates at all times.",
